    "sections": {
        "description": "The Project Manager Theme features a flexible and responsive design framework intended for presenting projects, schedules, services, and organizational information in a structured format. It includes customizable homepage layouts, content sections, banner areas, team showcases, and project display blocks that help organize information effectively. Users can adjust typography, colors, navigation styles, and page layouts through built-in customization options. The responsive framework ensures content remains accessible across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. Additional functionality includes blog integration, image galleries, contact sections, search support, and widgetized areas for extending website features. Multiple page templates provide flexibility when arranging project details, updates, documentation, and informational content. The theme also supports social media links, footer customization, and organized navigation menus that improve accessibility throughout the website. Design elements focus on readability and balanced spacing, helping content remain clear and easy to navigate. Compatibility with modern web standards and commonly used plugins allows for additional customization when needed. The overall structure supports consistent presentation of content while maintaining responsiveness and usability across a variety of screen sizes and browsing environments."
    },
